# Both Patina backends, Chibi 0.12 and Gauche 0.9.15 reproduce the defects.
# Driver comparison on all four hosts: 35/43 before; 43/43 after.
# Maintained slib-color-space smoke assertions cover the repaired behavior.
# Reference staging isolates transitive SLIB and SRFI dependencies; see
# docs/TEST_ORGANIZATION.md. The pinned vendor extraction is unchanged.
